Oh-oh!

52
00:04:10,020 --> 00:04:11,320
Ah!

53
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:34,680
Listen, you three. Try not to stand out. We're only here to case the joint. And whatever you do, don't get out of the carriage.

54
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:40,100
Stop it! What do you think you're doing? Where are you going?

55
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:43,440
Come back, you two!

56
00:04:44,380 --> 00:04:46,040
What a bunch of hard-headed idiots!

57
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:51,020
Settle down, Inosuke.

58
00:04:51,460 --> 00:04:56,180
Get back here, damn it! I'm talking to you, too! Are you listening to me?

59
00:04:59,300 --> 00:05:02,620
It's so bright. It looks like it's daytime.

60
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:10,440
Allow me to introduce you to the Yoshiwara Entertainment District, awash in vanity and desire.

61
00:05:11,440 --> 00:05:12,740
Flashy, isn't it?

62
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:18,480
What kind of place is this? There's too many people to even count!

63
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:24,480
Big way, Chucks! To now coming through!

64
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:27,280
Get back here, moron!

65
00:05:29,060 --> 00:05:31,940
Hey! Where'd the annoying kid with the yellow hair go?

66
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:32,500
What?

67
00:05:36,060 --> 00:05:38,040
Well, aren't you a handsome one?

68
00:05:38,780 --> 00:05:40,540
Why don't you come and join us?

69
00:05:40,540 --> 00:05:42,340
If you're hungry, we have candy!

70
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:51,600
No need to be shy, young man.

71
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:57,740
Beautiful ladies who make the first move? What am I gonna do?

72
00:05:58,460 --> 00:06:02,240
Not so fast! You're too young for that kind of stuff.

73
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:15,320
Take notes, you three. During the day, this place is quiet as a ghost town. But at night, it roars to life with all kinds of people. Ideal circumstances for a demon.

74
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:22,060
The women here are also unique. Many become courtesans and are sold off to pay their debts.

75
00:06:23,060 --> 00:06:29,060
In return, they're given food, clothing and lodging. And if they climb up the ranks, a rich man might buy out their contracts.

76
00:06:29,060 --> 00:06:34,020
The highest-ranking courtesan is referred to as Oiran, and she's on a whole different level.

77
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:38,360
Her beauty and intelligence are unrivaled, and she's mastered every traditional art.

78
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:44,440
A woman of distinction, bathed in her house's resources, to become their shining star.

79
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:46,620
She sounds incredible.

80
00:06:47,260 --> 00:06:50,600
I think that's enough reconnaissance for now. Let's go.

81
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:57,920
Sorry to impose.

82
