Listen up, you three.

83
00:07:03,380 --> 00:07:07,180
Once you're in the entertainment district, you should try to seek out my wives.

84
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:09,340
I'll search for any info on the demons.

85
00:07:13,020 --> 00:07:14,900
