86
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:15,920
Huh?

87
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,340
You're joking, right?

88
00:07:18,540 --> 00:07:22,460
How dare you order us to waste our time finding a bride for you, huh?

89
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:25,100
What? Why did I ever ask for something like that?

90
00:07:25,140 --> 00:07:27,100
Shut up! I'm not done talking here!

91
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:28,180
I need to, please!

92
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:34,480
Just because a freak like you has no luck with the ladies doesn't make it okay to use demon slayers like us for such a pitiful reason!

93
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,920
We're not helping you find a wife, you creep!

94
00:07:37,380 --> 00:07:38,760
What are you babbling about, idiot?

95
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:43,680
I'm talking about my wives who've infiltrated the entertainment district and are hard at work gathering intel!

96
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:47,720
Well, I've stopped receiving regular check-ins, so I need to ensure they're still safe!

97
00:07:50,140 --> 00:07:52,760
I suppose that is what a guy like you would fantasize.

98
00:07:53,380 --> 00:07:54,300
You damn punk!

99
00:07:54,300 --> 00:08:01,840
Here's your proof. Letters that were sent to me by Kasugai Krohn.

100
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:07,460
There's quite a lot of them here. She must have been undercover for quite some time.

101
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,540
Oh, well, I do have three wives.

102
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:13,360
What? Did you say wives? In three?

103
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:18,380
Three? Three? Three? Three wives? There's no way!

104
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:21,220
How did you of all people manage to get three wives?

105
00:08:21,300 --> 00:08:22,580
This is some kind of sick show!

106
00:08:24,140 --> 00:08:28,180
You got a problem with that, kid?

107
00:08:28,180 --> 00:08:37,520
Um, excuse me, but I noticed that in the letters they sent you, they all seem to keep reminding you not to stand out when you come.

108
00:08:37,920 --> 00:08:39,540
Which is why I'm sending you three!

109
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:42,080
So what are we going to do, exactly?

110
00:08:43,560 --> 00:08:47,780
Disguise yourselves, of course, and as much as I hate it, in an unflashy way.

111
00:08:49,060 --> 00:08:52,800
All three of my wives are brilliant ninjas known as kunoichis.

112
00:08:52,800 --> 00:09:01,360
I was almost certain that this district would be the perfect place for the demons, but when I went in as a customer, I couldn't get any info on them.

113
00:09:02,020 --> 00:09:05,580
So I sent each of them in to get closer than a customer ever could.

114
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:13,840
Since I've already narrowed down the likeliest houses to three, you all will search for my wives there and try to gather information.

115
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:20,400
Suma of the Tokito house, Makio of the Ogimoto house, and Hinatsuru of the Kyogoku house.

116
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:23,120
They're probably all dead if they stopped writing.

117
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:30,680
Pardon my intrusion, sir, but I brought back all of the items you requested earlier.

118
00:09:32,420 --> 00:09:33,260
Thank you.

119
00:09:33,260 --> 00:09:51,180
Oh my goodness.

120
00:09:51,900 --> 00:09:55,860
These three girls are certainly a homely bunch, aren't they?

121
00:09:55,860 --> 00:10:06,040
Oh, sorry. I'm afraid we're not looking to hire it this time.

122
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:08,960
I beg of you to find it in your heart to reconsider.

123
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:13,740
I believe that under your training, madam, their beauty will bloom in no time.

124
00:10:14,300 --> 00:10:15,860
That's very flattering, but...

125
00:10:16,540 --> 00:10:21,340
Well, I suppose taking in one wouldn't be a problem.

126
00:10:21,340 --> 00:10:25,340
I can assure you that you won't be disappointed.

127
00:10:25,880 --> 00:10:27,760
You may pick whichever girl you'd like.

128
00:10:28,260 --> 00:10:31,200
If we can choose, then I think we'll take the one in the middle.

129
00:10:31,500 --> 00:10:32,740
She looks the most obedient.

130
00:10:33,420 --> 00:10:35,660
I promise to work as hard as I can.

131
00:10:38,560 --> 00:10:41,140
Great. Now I'm stuck with you two brats.

132
00:10:41,460 --> 00:10:43,400
I'm gonna have to pay someone to take you.

133
00:10:43,400 --> 00:10:50,320
Stop talking to me. I don't want to hear it from you.

134
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:53,140
Are you upset you have to dress up as a girl?

135
00:10:53,820 --> 00:10:56,020
You said you'd do anything I asked, right?

136
00:10:57,540 --> 00:11:00,820
I don't give a damn that I'm dressed up like a girl, you moron.

137
00:11:01,860 --> 00:11:03,520
It's that face of yours.

138
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:05,700
You think you're such hot stuff?

139
00:11:06,060 --> 00:11:07,700
It pisses me the hell off!

140
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:12,260
Hey, look! Seems like there's a whole bunch of people swarming around over there.

141
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:41,020
Oh, that there is house Tokito's Oiran.

142
00:11:41,020 --> 00:11:43,560
Her name is Koinatsu.

143
00:11:44,540 --> 00:11:47,900
The highest-ranking courtesan is going off to meet her suitor.

144
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:50,020
How's that for being flashy?

145
00:11:50,980 --> 00:11:51,940
That her?!

146
00:11:51,940 --> 00:11:53,860
Are you telling me that's your wife?!

147
00:11:53,860 --> 00:11:55,940
How did you get with a knockout like her?!

148
00:11:55,940 --> 00:11:57,380
And what, you have three of them?!

149
00:11:57,380 --> 00:11:59,540
Do they all look like that, huh? Do they?!

150
00:11:59,540 --> 00:12:00,820
She's not my wife!

151
00:12:01,540 --> 00:12:03,360
Why did she walk so slow?

152
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:06,360
She'd be killed instantly if we were in the mountains.

153
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:17,080
Excuse me, sir, but I'll be taking this girl back to my house now, if that's all right.

154
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:19,360
I see. And you must be...

155
00:12:19,920 --> 00:12:23,060
Forgive me. I am the chaperone of the Ogimoto house.

156
00:12:23,620 --> 00:12:27,760
Well, if she managed to catch the eye of the Ogimoto house, how could I refuse?

157
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:31,160
May I ask what it was about her that caught your attention?

158
00:12:31,880 --> 00:12:35,240
Yes. Her beauty is unlike any I have ever seen.

159
00:12:35,760 --> 00:12:37,880
Take care of yourself out there, Inoko!

160
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:49,280
Oh, no! I'm the only one left here!

161
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:54,400
Take a look at her now!

162
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:55,860
She's perfect!

163
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:59,960
I wasn't sure with all that makeup plastered over her face, but my goodness!

164
00:13:00,580 --> 00:13:04,600
I can't believe I was able to buy this unrefined beauty for such a low price!

165
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:05,600
Mmm.

166
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:08,900
I'm gonna train this woman like nobody's business!

167
00:13:09,380 --> 00:13:14,680
When I'm through, she'll be in more demand than Kyokoku house's Warabihime or Tokito house's Koinatsu!

168
00:13:15,280 --> 00:13:18,000
This girl certainly has some heft to her, though, doesn't she?

169
00:13:18,160 --> 00:13:21,860
Well, it's better for a girl to be plump and curvy than scurvy, right?

170
00:13:22,060 --> 00:13:24,760
